error[ffi_unknown_field]: `fixedbugs-152-fields.h` declares no `c` in `struct named_s`: clang read the header, and that type has no such field
  at tests/golden/unsupported/fixedbugs-152-a-field-the-header-lacks-in-a-struct-named-for-its-tag.hero:13:9
